### PetClinic · Visits (a través del gateway)
### Requiere: gateway (:8080), visits-service (:8082) y customers-service (:8081)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/visits

### 1. Visitas del pet 7 (Samantha, owner 6), ordenadas por fecha (BR-PET-09)
GET {{baseUrl}}/owners/6/pets/7/visits

### 2. Reservar una visita (fecha estrictamente futura, BR-VIS-02)
POST {{baseUrl}}/owners/6/pets/7/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2027-01-15",
  "description": "annual checkup"
}

### 3. Fecha de hoy → 400 (BR-VIS-02)
POST {{baseUrl}}/owners/6/pets/7/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-14",
  "description": "too late"
}

### 4. Descripción de 256 caracteres → 400 (BR-VIS-01)
POST {{baseUrl}}/owners/6/pets/7/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2027-01-15",
  "description": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
}

### 5. Pet que no pertenece al owner → 404 (BR-VIS-03)
GET {{baseUrl}}/owners/1/pets/7/visits

### 6. Consulta masiva usada por el gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets/visits?petId=7,8

### 7. Con customers-service parado → 503 (ADR-005)
GET {{baseUrl}}/owners/6/pets/7/visits
